    Bind the parameter message evaluations to row coefficients
    
    The own relation rows can now bind a parameter vector evaluation to the
    committed folded message: the equality weights of the column point are
    scattered through the Gu message layout into the member's BAT table
    coefficients, with the width, point length and message room checked. Nothing
    reads a prover-supplied value. A test checks the coefficient mapping for both
    parameters and rejects a wrong point length and a vector that does not fit the
    message.
    
    partial progress

